  "label": "Racialized Hate Speech",
  "description": "Racialized hate speech is speech that targets individuals or groups based on their race or ethnicity, often using derogatory language or imagery to demean them. This meme is an example of racialized hate speech because it uses racist imagery (the chimpanzee) to attack Michelle Obama, a Black woman, based on her race. This concept is essential to understanding the meme’s hateful intent.",
